# Domain Rules

- Conversation belongs to a Learning Node.
- The tree is progressively materialized.
- Never generate a full knowledge tree eagerly.
- Only blocking questions become child nodes.
- Non-blocking adjacent questions belong in Frontier.
- Closing a node requires a convergence check.
- AI suggestions never directly mutate domain state.
